-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope and third-party data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This MIT License covers only the original code, documentation and synthetic
farm data in this repository. Third-party data, and the processed layers and
maps derived from it, remain under their original licences:

- OpenStreetMap data (roads and places)
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors. Open Data Commons Open Database License
  (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

- Ghana administrative boundaries (COD-AB)
  OCHA / Humanitarian Data Exchange. Creative Commons Attribution for
  Intergovernmental Organisations (CC BY-IGO):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/

- Hansen Global Forest Change v1.12
  Hansen/UMD/Google/USGS/NASA. Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Hansen, M. C. et al. (2013). Science 342, 850-853.
  doi:10.1126/science.1244693
